# Whitelist: `flyctl deploy` uploads this directory as the Docker build
# context to Fly's remote builder. Without this file that included .env,
# the local diagnostic scripts (*.mjs, with production credentials),
# node_modules and dist. Only what the Dockerfile COPYs may go up — when
# the Dockerfile starts copying something new, add it here too.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!migrations
